{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Territory Control 2 combines 2D physics-based industrial sandbox with 4X mechanics, allowing you to experience wonders such as...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Destruction!</strong> - ruining the environment with...</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All sorts of explosives!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unstable magitronic equipment!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trench warfare and artillery!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clumsy, careless giants!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using grandma's traditional porridge recipe as a masonry binding agent!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Engineering!</strong> - saving the day by...</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dragging your alcoholic friend out of a ditch with a winch!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mounting a heavy machine gun atop a capybara!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breaking a safe open by hurling it far away with a crane!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Placing a well-aligned shelf!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mass-producing extremely flimsy (but cheap) rifles!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer!</strong> - exploiting your friends to...</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight for your faction using your extremely flimsy (but cheap) rifles!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Establish a police state and take control of other players' lives!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operate heavy machinery and strip the entire map of all natural resources!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Commit crimes against humanity!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replace your former friends!</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"c17a0961b852f246c7fe5efdf169caf27ed5681c.jpg","localized_name":"The Missing Achievement","name":"The Missing Achievement","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstati